
  Folk tabletop live environment (Arch Linux)
  ===========================================

  Folk starts automatically as a systemd service:
      systemctl status folk        # logs: journalctl -u folk -f
      user: folk  password: folk   # folk has passwordless sudo

  Web UI:   http://localhost:4273  (or http://folk-live.local:4273)
  Source:   /home/folk/folk        (vendored deps prebuilt)

  Install onto this machine (e.g. to dual-boot):
      1. run `archinstall` and complete a normal install
      2. folk-install-to-disk /mnt/archinstall

